{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"お早う御座います  ◎°"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近、なぜだかとても眠くて、キャラが崩壊しています  ＼(^o^)／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うおういえあ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先日のイベントで、天使ですか？笑\nと沢山聞かれたので、わたしが\n空から降ってきてないということを\nここでアピールします(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"貴重な普段の眼鏡姿。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/12/27/photo.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうだちゃんと人間だろう！ 笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、地球を護るために\n地上に舞い降りた\n「護星天使」は大好きです＼(^o^)／てんそう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後に、昨日お仕事で行ったとこの\n空がキレイだったのでパシャリ  ＋＋"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/12/27/photo_2.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"空を見ると地球は\n丸いんだなって思うよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆにゃん"}],"source":"archive"}